  - Explains its purpose: relaunching `vox mens train` after process-level crashes.
  - Provides instructions on how to run the script.
  - Details the escalation ladder with a table showing model and sequence length changes at each rung.
  - Clarifies that each relaunch continues from the last saved checkpoint using `--resume`.

